ontext.ip"},{"type":"text","text":" as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"0.0.0.0\""},{"type":"text","text":". Customer.io’s references don’t say whether"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it takes that in place of the address it reads from an HTTP request."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Customer.io’s public keys ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"pk_..."},{"type":"text","text":") are client keys, safe to ship in an app: they let a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"client send data to the source and read nothing. Its private keys ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sk_..."},{"type":"text","text":") reach every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Customer.io API, deleting people included, and must not ship in an app, so the factory"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"refuses one."}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Throws","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/documentation\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/CustomerIOSetupError\/emptyAPIKey","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" for a key that is empty or only whitespace,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/documentation\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/CustomerIOSetupError\/privateKey","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" for a private key (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sk_..."},{"text":"), and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/documentation\/SegmentSpecEncoding\/CustomerIOSetupError\/regionMismatch","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" for a key whose region (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"pk_us_..."},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"pk_eu_..."},{"text":") isn’t ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"region"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]}],"kind":"cont